    "Now we subtract from numbers up to 20!",
    "Use ten to help: for 15 - 7, first take away 5 to get 10, then take away 2 more → 8.",
    "Count back or count UP: for 13 - 9, count up from 9 to 13 → that's 4!",
    "Addition partners still help: 8 + 6 = 14, so 14 - 6 = 8."
